00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:03.800
Yeah, he is.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.000
Please do your best to stay quiet for now.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:12.500
Myself and the others thank you greatly for saving us.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:18.200
