It's the ritual of checking for dirt beneath the nails.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.800
You're checking <i>that</i>  thorougly?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:33.600
In Noradz, we ensure everything is perfectly clean.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.600
Jasmine.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.100
Fine...

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.600
No dirt beneath the nails!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:41.630
No dirt beneath the nails!

