00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.500
W-Water...

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.700
U-Um... T-That water is for washing your hands.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.700
It's not for drinking.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.670
Say so sooner...

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.400
I'm sorry.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.800
You spilled food?!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.100
Spilled! Spilled!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:42.400
Capture that rude person!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.000
Capture her! Capture her!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.700
What is your name?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.100
T-Tira, Master Reece.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.300
Tira.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:57.600
Spilling food is an act of pure evil.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.600
I'm so sorry, Master Reece.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.800
Please... forgive me...

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.800
Tira...

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.500
Guilty.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.300
Guilty! Guilty!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:15.000
You must be whipped one hundred times to expel the evil.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.400
Clean Noradzeer.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.300
Clean Noradzeer.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.400
Just for spilling some food...?

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.900
This is too horrible...!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.100
Please stop!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.900
It was my fault.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.000
I was the one who dropped the bread.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.100
It was you...?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.900
Yes, I'm very sorry.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.000
You are a filthy foreigner.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:02.000
However, you people don't know of our ways.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:07.100
The Nine have decided that you are not guilty.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.880
Thank you very much!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.600
Honestly... how reckless can you be?

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.600
I couldn't just ignore it.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.900
Let's get out of here as soon as we can.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.500
Filli!

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:28.000
You've finally shown yourself.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:04.100
A...An evil creature has appeared in the dining hall of our city!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:14.800
Filli!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:20.300
Look! The girl has touched the evil with her body; she must be killed!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.600
Kill her!

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.400
Run, Filli.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.900
Hide yourself somewhere.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.500
Girl! Hand it over!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:31.900
Run!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.000
You...!

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.900
Damn it! It's getting away!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:06.000
These filthy people brought evil into our dining hall!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.700
They're trying to destroy us!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:13.000
A trial! You three will be trialed!

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.200
Did you find that evil creature?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.600
No, not yet.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:36.600
We cannot wait any longer.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.300
Let the trial begin!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:48.300
Because of these filthy people, evil is now present in this city.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:52.200
They have broken our sacred law.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:16:00.000
We, the Nine Ra-Kacharz, are calling for the death sentence.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.200
What?!

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.400
Death sentence?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:13.100
However, in deference to the merciful law of Noradz, I will leave the decision to this sacred vessel.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:28.300
As the head of the Ra-Kacharz, I, Reece, desire democracy for our city.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.700
What's this 'sacred vessel' he's talking about?

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:39.400
The sacred vessel shall reveal the truth.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.750
Clean Noradzeer.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.100
Clean Noradzeer.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.400
Life...

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.900
...and death?

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:54.000
One of you three will draw a card from the sacred vessel.

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:59.300
A 'sacred vessel'?

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.900
Isn't this just plain chance?!

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:05.100
Whether we live or die will be decided based on luck?

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.250
That's not fair!

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.600
Now... who's going to volunteer?

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.900
I will.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.700
Then come forward.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.900
Face the front.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.400
Now then, I shall place the cards in the sacred vessel.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.100
Now, draw one.

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:15.570
Which one is life and which one is death?

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.100
Now, show me the card.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.500
Which card did you draw?

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:43.000
I've drawn the card of death...

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.800
It's the end... we're going to be killed!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.800
What?

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.200
She's saying something.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.500
"They're both death..."

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.200
They're both death?!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.000
Both of them are death cards?!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
What's wrong? Hurry and show it to me!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.600
That means this guy's cheated.

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:21.700
If I show him the card, we're all going to be killed. But...

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:26.700
Even if the other card is death, he probably wouldn't just admit that he rigged the draw.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.700
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.100
That's right!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:37.200
The topaz helps the wearer to calm the mind and see the truth.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.970
Bring it to me now!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:56.600
Right.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.100
I'm very sorry.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.100
The card has burned and disintegrated.

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:17.600
But,

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.800
There's still a way for you to tell which card I just drew.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.700
What?

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:28.000
You just have to look at the card that's left in the sacred vessel.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.550
Show me the card.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.500
The card is death, Master Reece.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.000
If the card that's left is death...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.500
Then the one that burned was life!

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:55.050
This person didn't draw death and instead drew life.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.100
Good work, Lief!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:00.200
Let's hurry up and get out of this city.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:04.700
As the decision states, enjoy your life...

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:07.000
In prison!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.900
Take these three and lock them in our jail!

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.000
They can spend the rest of their days there in repentance!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.200
What?!

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.000
What do you mean "jail"?!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.600
It is imperative that the city of Noradz be kept clean.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.000
We cannot forgive anyone who brings filth here.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:37.300
Now, find the filthy creature that brought evil to our city!

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:40.700
Hurry and find it, then exterminate it!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.200
Let me go!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:08.100
No! I'm not staying here forever!

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:16.300
No! Let us out!

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:19.300
Let us out, let us out!

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:21.400
I said to let us out!

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:23.600
Let us out!

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:25.600
Open this door!

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:28.400
Can't you hear me?! Let us out now!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:08.400
The Nine Ra-Kacharz.

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:15.000
The priests who conduct strange rituals and enforce severe laws to protect the city of Noradz.

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:19.600
Each clothed in red, they deal out strict
punishment to those who break their laws.

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:26.900
After we were thrown in jail so suddenly, we succeeded in persuading Tira to let us out.

00:24:27.300 --> 00:24:30.400
But, the head of the Ra-Kacharz, Reece, chased us down.

00:24:30.830 --> 00:24:31.100
Escape from Prison

00:24:31.100 --> 00:24:33.700
Next time, 'Escape from Prison'!
Escape from Prison

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:34.670
Escape from Prison
